{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是文化日，学校休息。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『爱理来了』", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0372", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，是吗……都没注意到」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像是在我打扫卫生期间濑名去樱乃的房间找她玩了。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": "好像是在我打扫卫生期间濑名去樱乃的房间找她玩了。", "plain_idx": 207, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「濑名今天不用打工的吗……？」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话说回来，樱乃招待朋友来家里玩也是少见，\\n这也是濑名第一次到我家来吧。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": "话说回来，樱乃招待朋友来家里玩也是少见，这也是濑名第一次到我家来吧。", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为了不打扰她们，我是不是应该窝在自己房间里比较好……", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，或者出门一趟更好……？」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过考虑了几分钟后，我已经在厨房认真地准备茶点了。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "不过考虑了几分钟后，我已经在厨房认真地准备茶点了。", "plain_idx": 213, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然刚刚已经换了衣服走到门口了。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然是熟人到家里来做客，\\n　果然还是去打个招呼为好吧……嗯，就这样」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": "「既然是熟人到家里来做客，　果然还是去打个招呼为好吧……嗯，就这样」", "plain_idx": 216, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "记得家里还有曲奇来着，一起拿过去吧……", "text_idx": 217, "plain": "记得家里还有曲奇来着，一起拿过去吧……", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打扰啦……」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我单手端着茶点推开了樱乃的房门。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我才是，多有叨扰」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0728", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢了，哥」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0373", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事没事，不管怎么说都是熟人来家里做客了嘛……」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说来我也很长时间没有进过樱乃的房间了呢，\\n　来，濑名，请喝茶」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": "「说来我也很长时间没有进过樱乃的房间了呢，　来，濑名，请喝茶」", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢……你平时不进樱乃房间吗？」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0729", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名接过茶杯，脸上露出了惊讶的神色。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": "濑名接过茶杯，脸上露出了惊讶的神色。", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从初遇的那天以后\\n——这还是第一次见她穿便服。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "从初遇的那天以后——这还是第一次见她穿便服。", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "给人干净利落的感觉，\\n和那些在家不修边幅，穿运动服或者浴服的人完全不同。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "给人干净利落的感觉，和那些在家不修边幅，穿运动服或者浴服的人完全不同。", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还以为你们在家里关系会更好呢……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0730", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一般来说都是樱乃来我的房间，是吧」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0374", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃也接过了茶杯，如往常一般安静地点了点头。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": "樱乃也接过了茶杯，如往常一般安静地点了点头。", "plain_idx": 240, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，说来你的书还在我那呢，等会给你拿过来」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": "「啊，说来你的书还在我那呢，等会给你拿过来」", "plain_idx": 241, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事，那个不是忘在那的」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0375", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「回头还要到哥那儿去继续读的」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0376", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，嗯，原来如此」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我向濑名耸了耸肩，表示“就是这样”。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……在学校也是，在家也是，都是这样呢」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0731", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，也是」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0732", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "仿佛是理解了什么一般，濑名露出了微笑。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她轻轻地举起杯子。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我就不客气了，瓜生」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0733", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，趁热喝吧。\\n　那我就出去了，你们慢慢聊……」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": "「嗯，趁热喝吧。　那我就出去了，你们慢慢聊……」", "plain_idx": 258, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，等等」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0734", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在我马上要走出房间的时候，\\n濑名不知为何出声叫住了我。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "在我马上要走出房间的时候，濑名不知为何出声叫住了我。", "plain_idx": 262, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个……瓜、瓜生等下有事吗？」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0735", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没，并没有什么事……？」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那好不容易来一次，多呆一会不行吗？\\n　来送个茶就走，不是显得有点太冷淡了嘛」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": "「那好不容易来一次，多呆一会不行吗？　来送个茶就走，不是显得有点太冷淡了嘛」", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0736", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哈啊」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃，这样可以吗？」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0737", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0377", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我哥的茶就由我来泡吧」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0378", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有劳了，瓜生，来坐下吧」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0738", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然搞不太懂现在的情况……", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，那就麻烦你往旁边挪一挪吧」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谁叫你在我旁边坐啦！」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0739", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名今天对于玩笑的反应也不错。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "无论如何，都已经受到了邀请，如果拒绝走掉就太不礼貌了，\\n我就这样加入了两人的茶话会。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "无论如何，都已经受到了邀请，如果拒绝走掉就太不礼貌了，我就这样加入了两人的茶话会。", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自然是没有坐在濑名旁边。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「——不过还真是没想到要来樱乃家还要花这么长时间」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "「——不过还真是没想到要来樱乃家还要花这么长时间」", "plain_idx": 285, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0740", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到惠民超市的路我已经走惯了，\\n　听说你家距离那儿走路只要五分钟，\\n　我还以为很轻松就能找到呢……」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "「到惠民超市的路我已经走惯了，　听说你家距离那儿走路只要五分钟，　我还以为很轻松就能找到呢……」", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 52, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0741", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「路走熟了之前都不可大意」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0379", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说的是啊……走熟了之后怎么都好，问题是那之前」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": "「说的是啊……走熟了之后怎么都好，问题是那之前」", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0742", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使是完美的濑名，碰上第一次走的路也会迷路啊……\\n我一边在心里这么想着，一边喝了一口茶。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "即使是完美的濑名，碰上第一次走的路也会迷路啊……我一边在心里这么想着，一边喝了一口茶。", "plain_idx": 295, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "目前我只不过是一个负责在一旁凑人数的配角，\\n这时候还是搞明白自己的身份，不要说话为好吧。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": "目前我只不过是一个负责在一旁凑人数的配角，这时候还是搞明白自己的身份，不要说话为好吧。", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0380", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说到这里樱乃忽然把话题抛给了我。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「教我不会迷路的秘诀」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0381", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "你还真是出了个难题啊，吾妹。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是呢，我也想知道呢，“哥”」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0743", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃，你想想，\\n　不是总有人说“男女的大脑构成是不一样的”吗——」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "「樱乃，你想想，　不是总有人说“男女的大脑构成是不一样的”吗——」", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0744", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0382", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便如此，我也觉得你俩的迷路水平也太高了。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘛。让我想想……唔嗯」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算路不熟，只是方向的话……\\n　呃，应该能搞明白吧？」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "「就算路不熟，只是方向的话……　呃，应该能搞明白吧？」", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「能搞明白就不用苦恼了」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0745", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「前边是北」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0383", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这个错的也太离谱了吧！」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0746", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「上方是北才对吧」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0747", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样啊」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0384", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我倒是清楚方向啦，但完全搞不懂这俩人在说啥……", "text_idx": 325, "plain": "我倒是清楚方向啦，但完全搞不懂这俩人在说啥……", "plain_idx": 325, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那个濑名啊，从惠民超市到这里，\\n　你是怎么找过来的？」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": "「……那个濑名啊，从惠民超市到这里，　你是怎么找过来的？」", "plain_idx": 327, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃有给我发指路的短信」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0748", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这个」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0385", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我看看……？」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是有什么带导航的网址吗……我看向樱乃的手机。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": "是有什么带导航的网址吗……我看向樱乃的手机。", "plain_idx": 333, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『出了惠民超市后往斜前方走，\\n　过了烟草店的红绿灯右转，\\n　然后走到红屋顶的房子那里左转——』", "text_idx": 334, "plain": "『出了惠民超市后往斜前方走，　过了烟草店的红绿灯右转，　然后走到红屋顶的房子那里左转——』", "plain_idx": 335, "len": 49, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0386", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然我按照短信的指示，\\n　在烟草店那里转弯了……」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": "「虽然我按照短信的指示，　在烟草店那里转弯了……」", "plain_idx": 338, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0749", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理大概是在那个有很多自贩机的地方转弯了」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": "「爱理大概是在那个有很多自贩机的地方转弯了」", "plain_idx": 340, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0387", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是吧？！那里不是烟草店吗？」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0750", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我说啊，以后去什么地方之前，\\n　最好还是上网查查路线比较好……」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": "「……我说啊，以后去什么地方之前，　最好还是上网查查路线比较好……」", "plain_idx": 345, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我家没有电脑……而且为了这个专门去一趟学校感觉也不太好」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": "「我家没有电脑……而且为了这个专门去一趟学校感觉也不太好」", "plain_idx": 346, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0751", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥，就算看了，不实际走一次也搞不明白的」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0388", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实……就是搞不明白，在走了很多回，\\n　在我切实感觉到“这是我的道路”前，\\n　我连上下左右都很难分清楚……」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": "「确实……就是搞不明白，在走了很多回，　在我切实感觉到“这是我的道路”前，　我连上下左右都很难分清楚……」", "plain_idx": 351, "len": 57, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0752", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0389", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能够自然而然在脑海中形成地图的我，\\n总感觉与这个空间有些格格不入……", "text_idx": 355, "plain": "能够自然而然在脑海中形成地图的我，总感觉与这个空间有些格格不入……", "plain_idx": 356, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怎么说呢……嗯，两个容易迷路的人开始热闹地讨论起了迷路心得，\\n我是不是差不多应该退场了？", "text_idx": 357, "plain": "怎么说呢……嗯，两个容易迷路的人开始热闹地讨论起了迷路心得，我是不是差不多应该退场了？", "plain_idx": 358, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，我这就……」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正当我一边说着一边站起来的时候——", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么啊」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0753", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被瞪了两眼之后我只好乖乖坐下。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "坐是坐了……但我才想问为什么呢？", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，樱乃完全不用担心吧，\\n　即使迷路了也会有“哥”来找」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": "「不过，樱乃完全不用担心吧，　即使迷路了也会有“哥”来找」", "plain_idx": 366, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0754", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0390", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还有下次的话就再请哥为我解围了」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0391", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
